<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 4.29 points off FTSE, May 27.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 4.29 points off FTSE, May 27.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on May 27 and analysts estimate this will take 4.29 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>						DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>						(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>    COMPANY			  Net   Gross	Gross</p>
<p>   * Cable &amp; Wireless	    7.70   9.625     1.251</p>
<p>   * Marks &amp; Spencer	     9.70  12.125     2.000</p>
<p>   * Next			   10.00  12.500     0.275</p>
<p>   * Safeway			 9.70  12.125     0.764</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
